window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Complete 4-book box set series</p> <p>I’ll do whatever it takes to be free of my fated mate….</p> <p>As a half-wolf outcast with powers, my soul mate rejected me, and despite throwing me off a cliff, by some miracle, I survived.</p> <p>Only to find myself entangled with four dangerous Viking Wolves who awaken a passion within me that ignites fire through my veins and heat into my bones. They see my potential. See <i>me</i> despite my unique blend of darkness that I attract to us.</p> <p>With me at their side, they want to conquer our broken wolf world and take reign.</p> <p>But it's a deadly game, one I won't play without a few demands of my own—Help me get revenge against my fated mate, no matter the cost.</p> <p><i>Her Forbidden Protector</i> is a four-book Wolf Shifter Rejeted Mate, Omegaverse Romance filled with four dominating Norse alpha males and a strong, sassy heroine who tames them all. Full of romance, non-stop action, and suspense, these diverse characters will tear at your heart and keep you reading until the very last page! Don’t miss this chance to read the complete series today! Her Forbidden Protector includes the complete collection of the Savage Sector books:</p> <p><i>Lost Wolf<br> Broken Wolf<br> Fated Wolf<br> Cursed Wolf</i></p>"; 
